# S016099 candidate summary

The candidate adds the path-preserving Rust translation for
`include/uapi/linux/dev_energymodel.h`.

- Preserves the SPDX licensing expression and generated-header provenance.
- Preserves both named C enum namespaces with explicit `i32` representation.
- Preserves all anonymous enum constants, source-order values, and max-sentinel
  arithmetic.
- Preserves family and multicast-group string macros and family version.
- Contains only declarations; the upstream header has no executable behavior,
  allocation, synchronization, ownership transfer, or ABI-visible storage.
